### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Create Task - Minimal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Task"
}

### Create Task - Full
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete API Documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive docs for all endpoints",
  "priority": "high",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}
